# changeling, but no creature spell - and does cast Llanowar Elves. Turn 3: two kinds of restricted green mana are in the
# pool, the Territory's and Maelstrom of the Spirit Dragon's (Dragon or Omen spells), each its own (CR 106.6): the second
# Llanowar Elves is paid with the Territory's, and the Maelstrom's {G} is left.

